Krita Nova 43 - Clear button in the Layers docker

The Layers docker gets a "Clear" button right after "Duplicate", with the
eraser icon (draw-eraser). It triggers Edit > Clear ("clear"): clears the
active layer, or only the selected area when there is a selection; it is
enabled and disabled together with that action.

LayerBox.cpp / WdgLayerBox.ui: bnClear.
diff --git a/plugins/dockers/layerdocker/LayerBox.cpp b/plugins/dockers/layerdocker/LayerBox.cpp
